{"author": "edwong57", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete \n\nGO:0010602 regulation of 1-aminocyclopropane-1-carboxylate metabolic process\nGO:0090357 regulation of L-tryptophan metabolic process\nGO:1901494 regulation of cysteine metabolic process\nGO:0090358 positive regulation of L-tryptophan metabolic process\nGO:0090368 regulation of ornithine metabolic process\nGO:2000212 negative regulation of glutamate metabolic process\nGO:2000214 regulation of L-proline metabolic process\nGO:2000211 regulation of glutamate metabolic process\n\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/31171\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1ydiWizT-lDt34XgSTG8uu4ACS4WkdMVeNbqpVsjkUqI/edit?usp=sharing\n\nImpacted groups: \n\nBHF-UCL | 2 - done\nEcoCyc | 2\nFlyBase | 1\nMGI | 8\nPseudoCAP | 1\nReactome | 3\nRGD | 1\nSGD | 6\nTAIR | 10\nUniProt | 3\n\n\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2026-02-17T04:03:59Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to regulation of metabolic process terms", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-03-02T19:45:38Z"}
